Employee Data Entry Form – Excel

Project Overview
An Excel-based Employee Data Entry Form designed to simplify employee information entry and maintain structured employee records.

Features
Employee data entry through a user-friendly form
Employee Name and Employee Code
Email ID and Date of Birth
Department selection:
Technical
Admin
Accounts
H.R
Location selection:
Site
Office
Salary components:
Basic Salary
HRA
Medical
Conveyance
Deductions
Automatic Net Pay calculation
Submit button to transfer/store employee information
Structured employee database for record keeping
Form-based interface instead of directly entering data into the database
Skills Demonstrated

Microsoft Excel | Data Validation | Form Design | Excel Formulas | Data Entry Automation | Basic VBA/Macros
